graph TB
    SCAN[LiDAR Scan\n360° ranges] --> PREPROC[Preprocess\n- NaN/Inf -> 0\n- Clamp to 6m\n- Moving avg WINDOW_SIZE=10]
    PREPROC --> MASK[Mask Bubble\nBUBBLE_RADIUS=10\naround closest obstacle]
    MASK --> FIND_GAP[Find Max Gap\nRANGE_THRESHOLD=1.0m]
    FIND_GAP --> BEST_POINT[Best Point in Gap\nMin |gap_angle - user_heading|]
    BEST_POINT --> STEER[Steering Angle]
    STEER --> VEL[Velocity Limits\nANGLE_LIMIT=80°\nVELOCITY_LIMITS]
    VEL --> CMD[Twist: linear.x, angular.z]
    
    USER[User Heading\nfrom prediction_topic] --> BEST_POINT
